WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.133 --> 00:00:03.434
-President Biden used
his first

00:00:03.434 --> 00:00:05.133
State of the Union address to
condemn Vladimir Putin's

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:07.100
invasion of Ukraine
and warned Putin

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.000
that he has no idea
what the U.S.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.300
and its allies will do next.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.367
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:16.467
♪♪

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:18.300
I have to say it just seems
exhausting

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.234
to be a Republican
politician these days.

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:23.801
Every minor inconvenience
is somehow a secret plot

00:00:23.801 --> 00:00:26.367
to cancel you or indoctrinate
you into becoming

00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:28.501
an Antifa Marxist woken-ista,

00:00:28.501 --> 00:00:31.267
and I don't know what that is,
but I think it's bad.

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:32.868
Everything is a perceived slight

00:00:32.868 --> 00:00:35.300
and you have to be constantly
outraged all the time.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.434
Like yesterday, for example,
Senator Marco Rubio skipped

00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:40.634
President Biden's first
State of the Union address,

00:00:40.634 --> 00:00:42.400
where the President laid
out his plans for,

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.901
among other things,
deterring a brutal dictator,

00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:46.534
who's invading
a sovereign country

00:00:46.534 --> 00:00:48.334
and dealing
with a global pandemic.

00:00:48.334 --> 00:00:49.667
And Rubio said it was

00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:52.400
because he didn't want to
get tested for COVID.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:53.701
-Not every Republican is here.

00:00:53.701 --> 00:00:56.534
Marco Rubio, the Republican
senator from Florida,

00:00:56.534 --> 00:00:57.767
said he wouldn't be attending

00:00:57.767 --> 00:00:59.634
because he didn't have time
to get tested.

00:00:59.634 --> 00:01:02.501
-Senator Rubio told
another media outlet

00:01:02.501 --> 00:01:04.501
he wasn't taking
a COVID 19 test

00:01:04.501 --> 00:01:07.067
because he didn't
have time for it.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:08.901
-I'm sorry what?
You don't have time

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:12.100
to get your nose swabbed
for 10 seconds,

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:13.334
but there's two
possibilities here.

00:01:13.334 --> 00:01:15.901
One, Marco Rubio is a bozo
pandering to a base

00:01:15.901 --> 00:01:17.801
that somehow thinks
a 10-second nose swab

00:01:17.801 --> 00:01:18.868
is an act of tyranny.

00:01:18.868 --> 00:01:21.901
Or two,
he's been taking the wrong test.

00:01:21.901 --> 00:01:23.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.767 --> 00:01:26.834
In which case I empathize
with this poor man.

00:01:26.834 --> 00:01:29.767
I don't have time to go inside
that big metal tube

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:32.868
and get spooked by
all the banging.

00:01:32.868 --> 00:01:35.701
Oh Marco, you've been
taking an MRI?

00:01:35.701 --> 00:01:38.567
Oh man. You mean
when these people?

00:01:38.567 --> 00:01:40.834
Maybe it's the same reason
they're anti-mask too.

00:01:40.834 --> 00:01:43.000
You know, Marco has probably
been wearing it over his eyes.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.801
Banging is nuts in the stuff
10, 20 times a day.

00:01:45.801 --> 00:01:47.300
And here I am,
giving him a hard time.

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:48.968
I'm sorry, bro. I'm sorry.

00:01:48.968 --> 00:01:50.501
Look, it sucks for normal people

00:01:50.501 --> 00:01:52.267
who have to wait
in long lines for COVID tests,

00:01:52.267 --> 00:01:55.534
but Rubio is a senator it would
literally taken 30 seconds.

00:01:55.534 --> 00:01:57.934
I can tell you, because I still
get tested three times a week,

00:01:57.934 --> 00:02:00.400
even though I've had
three shots and got COVID,

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.100
I'm basically super immune now.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.934
The other day,
just to test my immune system,

00:02:03.934 --> 00:02:07.100
I got on the F train,
took my mask off and did this.

00:02:10.367 --> 00:02:14.200
And I didn't get COVID,
I did catch mange.

00:02:17.133 --> 00:02:18.467
Which isn't great, but,
you know,

00:02:18.467 --> 00:02:21.868
I still prove my point.

00:02:21.868 --> 00:02:24.968
Again, this was a joint address
to Congress and yeah,

00:02:24.968 --> 00:02:29.367
I'm a little lightheaded
from how I breathed.

00:02:29.367 --> 00:02:31.200
It's touch and go now,
whether or not

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:34.000
I'll make it through the "Look."

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.934
And again, this was
a joint address to Congress,

00:02:35.934 --> 00:02:37.767
where the president
praised brave Ukrainians

00:02:37.767 --> 00:02:39.000
for resisting
Russian aggression

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.400
and laid out his plan
to deter Putin,

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.634
among many other things.
And Rubio just skipped it

00:02:43.634 --> 00:02:45.601
because he didn't want
to get his nose swabbed.

00:02:45.601 --> 00:02:46.834
I mean, sorry, man,

00:02:46.834 --> 00:02:49.167
but you don't get to say
no thanks

00:02:49.167 --> 00:02:50.767
when you have
an important work meeting.

00:02:50.767 --> 00:02:52.868
Certainly the rest of us
don't have that option.

00:02:52.868 --> 00:02:54.601
I can't just skip
our show's annual

00:02:54.601 --> 00:02:55.901
Respect
in the Workplace Meeting

00:02:55.901 --> 00:02:57.534
because I don't want
to get a COVID test.

00:02:57.534 --> 00:02:59.501
Even our cue card guy,
Wally couldn't skip it.

00:02:59.501 --> 00:03:02.400
Although he definitely
put in the bare minimum effort

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:03.801
by zooming
into the meeting,

00:03:03.801 --> 00:03:07.100
and this is 100% real
while lying on his bed.

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:09.534
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:03:09.534 --> 00:03:15.300
Again, this is a real
a real screenshot

00:03:15.300 --> 00:03:20.300
from a Respect
in the Workplace Meeting.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:24.200
We'll even put an arrow in
so you can see where he is.

00:03:26.234 --> 00:03:29.667
And if that shot looks familiar,
that's because he showed up

00:03:29.667 --> 00:03:31.567
at the State of the Union
last night.

00:03:31.567 --> 00:03:34.467
-I think I have a better idea
to fight inflation.

00:03:34.467 --> 00:03:36.868
Lower your cost, not your wages.

00:03:36.868 --> 00:03:43.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:43.534 --> 00:03:45.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:45.634 --> 00:03:49.300
-So, Rubio, now you're doing it
with the cards, Wally?

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.968
-Yeah. Hey, Seth, you know,
from what I remember,

00:03:51.968 --> 00:03:54.000
I'm pretty sure the Respect
in the Workplace Seminar

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.400
also said you shouldn't
tease employees on national TV.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:59.234
-Put the cards up, Wally!
-Alright.

00:03:59.234 --> 00:04:01.400
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:03.501 --> 00:04:05.534
-So Rubio couldn't be bothered
to show up

00:04:05.534 --> 00:04:06.834
to a State of the Union address.

00:04:06.834 --> 00:04:09.067
Meanwhile, some of the
Republicans who did show up

00:04:09.067 --> 00:04:11.000
were disruptive ass[bleep]
like Lauren Boebert

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.334
and Marjorie Taylor Greene.

00:04:12.334 --> 00:04:14.334
First, they pulled the dumb
stunt where they turned

00:04:14.334 --> 00:04:16.901
their back on Biden's cabinet
as they entered the chamber.

00:04:16.901 --> 00:04:19.601
Although, I genuinely can't tell
if they're turning their backs

00:04:19.601 --> 00:04:23.300
or if they are just wasted and
don't know which way to look.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:24.834
I mean, they have the vibe
and posture

00:04:24.834 --> 00:04:26.667
of two college sophomores
at a party

00:04:26.667 --> 00:04:28.234
looking for a friend
who left hours ago.

00:04:28.234 --> 00:04:29.734
[ Imitates female voice ]
Jessica!

00:04:29.734 --> 00:04:33.067
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.067 --> 00:04:35.701
Jessica.

00:04:35.701 --> 00:04:37.834
[ Normal voice ]
And was that supposed to
be a powerful statement?

00:04:37.834 --> 00:04:39.300
You don't look like
you're turning your backs,

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.300
so you look like
you're waiting for your Uber

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:44.000
after getting kicked out of an
Applebee's on St. Patrick's Day

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.634
for drinking one, too many
Tipsy Leprechauns.

00:04:46.634 --> 00:04:49.701
By the way, that is a real thing
you can order an Applebee's.

00:04:49.701 --> 00:04:51.934
It's the drink most offensive
to Irish people

00:04:51.934 --> 00:04:54.968
since they stopped serving
their IRA themed sparkling wine.

00:04:54.968 --> 00:04:56.167
The Troubles Bubbles.

00:04:56.167 --> 00:04:57.667
[ Laughter ]

00:04:57.667 --> 00:05:01.501
Aaanyway.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:01.501 --> 00:05:02.801
Greene and Boebert
weren't done there,

00:05:02.801 --> 00:05:05.367
they later heckled Biden
during the part of his speech

00:05:05.367 --> 00:05:08.167
on immigration by yelling
"Build the wall" at him.

00:05:08.167 --> 00:05:09.601
They were drowned out
by applause,

00:05:09.601 --> 00:05:12.133
but there's a photo of them
yelling during the speech

00:05:12.133 --> 00:05:14.033
where they look like
too overbearing

00:05:14.033 --> 00:05:16.734
Little League moms berating
their kids from the stands.

00:05:16.734 --> 00:05:20.667
[ Imitates mom yelling ]
Come on, Tyler, you
got to catch that!

00:05:20.667 --> 00:05:23.267
This is T-ball, Tyler!

00:05:23.267 --> 00:05:25.667
[ Normal voice ] Now that
picture might make you angry,

00:05:25.667 --> 00:05:27.567
but if I've learned anything.

00:05:27.567 --> 00:05:30.267
Any one thing from watching
"Real Housewives,"

00:05:30.267 --> 00:05:31.801
it's that two white ladies

00:05:31.801 --> 00:05:34.601
this erratic will eventually
turn on one another.

00:05:34.601 --> 00:05:35.901
[ Laughter ]

00:05:35.901 --> 00:05:39.567
Oh, sure, they agree now,
but you wait, you just wait.

00:05:39.567 --> 00:05:41.667
[ As Greene] Did you take my
"stop the steal" mask?

00:05:41.667 --> 00:05:42.767
[ As Boebert ] I borrowed it.

00:05:42.767 --> 00:05:46.400
[ As Greene ]
Well, stop the borrow!

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.200
[ Normal voice ] All these
people want is attention,

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.000
and they're willing to do
anything to get it,

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.434
including yelling
at the President

00:05:51.434 --> 00:05:52.667
during an address to the nation.

00:05:52.667 --> 00:05:54.734
And look, I don't care
that much about decorum.

00:05:54.734 --> 00:05:56.267
I do care about
not being annoying.

00:05:56.267 --> 00:05:58.067
And these two are some of
the most annoying people

00:05:58.067 --> 00:05:59.434
I've ever seen
on the national stage.

00:05:59.434 --> 00:06:02.534
I mean, they're like
a nonstop national hangnail.

00:06:02.534 --> 00:06:04.400
They remind me of the kids
in high school

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:07.133
who thought they should be
starring in the school musical,

00:06:07.133 --> 00:06:08.667
even though they couldn't
sing for [bleep]

00:06:08.667 --> 00:06:11.467
so they'd be in the background,
wearing a tree costume

00:06:11.467 --> 00:06:14.601
and would just creep up stage
during the final number.

00:06:14.601 --> 00:06:16.100
And then as for the Democrats,

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.868
there was Senate Majority
Leader Chuck Schumer,

00:06:17.868 --> 00:06:20.000
who preemptively started
applauding a line

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.167
Biden's speech before Biden
actually got to it,

00:06:22.167 --> 00:06:24.167
producing this awkward moment.

00:06:24.167 --> 00:06:26.400
-Unlike the $2 trillion tax
cut passed

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.234
in the previous administration

00:06:28.234 --> 00:06:30.367
that benefited the top
one percent of Americans

00:06:30.367 --> 00:06:32.067
the American Rescue Plan --

00:06:32.067 --> 00:06:34.467
[ Booing ]

00:06:34.467 --> 00:06:37.868
The American Rescue Plan
help working people

00:06:37.868 --> 00:06:39.567
and left no one behind.

00:06:42.033 --> 00:06:45.000
-He looked like the overeager
dad at the high school play

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.801
who tries to start an ovation
for his two weird nieces.

00:06:47.801 --> 00:06:49.567
How about them?

00:06:49.567 --> 00:06:51.634
They didn't know all the words,
but they sure have moxie.

00:06:51.634 --> 00:06:54.133
No? Okay.

00:06:54.133 --> 00:06:55.534
Now, it won't surprise you
to hear

00:06:55.534 --> 00:06:58.367
that Biden began his speech
with a strong denunciation

00:06:58.367 --> 00:06:59.934
of Vladimir Putin's
invasion of Ukraine.

00:06:59.934 --> 00:07:01.834
He applauded the bravery
and courage of Ukrainians

00:07:01.834 --> 00:07:03.734
defending their country
and announced plans

00:07:03.734 --> 00:07:05.667
to go after the wealth
of Russian oligarchs

00:07:05.667 --> 00:07:07.801
with an ad-libbed line
at the end,

00:07:07.801 --> 00:07:10.334
teasing that there's potentially
more to come.

00:07:10.334 --> 00:07:12.901
-Tonight,
I say to the Russian oligarchs

00:07:12.901 --> 00:07:15.868
and the corrupt leaders
who bilked billions of dollars

00:07:15.868 --> 00:07:18.968
off this violent regime,
"No more."

00:07:18.968 --> 00:07:20.467
The United States --

00:07:20.467 --> 00:07:22.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:22.934 --> 00:07:24.400
I mean it.

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:27.634
The United States'
Department of Justice

00:07:27.634 --> 00:07:29.934
is assembling
a dedicated task force

00:07:29.934 --> 00:07:33.033
to go after the crimes
of the Russian oligarchs.

00:07:33.033 --> 00:07:34.567
We're joining
with European allies

00:07:34.567 --> 00:07:36.367
to find and seize their yachts,

00:07:36.367 --> 00:07:39.934
their luxury apartments,
their private jets.

00:07:39.934 --> 00:07:43.133
We're coming for your
ill begotten gains,

00:07:43.133 --> 00:07:46.767
and tonight I'm announcing
that we will join our allies

00:07:46.767 --> 00:07:50.000
in closing off American airspace
to all Russian flights.

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:51.767
Further isolating Russia

00:07:51.767 --> 00:07:54.067
and adding additional squeeze
on their economy.

00:07:54.267 --> 00:08:01.234
[ Applause ]

00:08:03.467 --> 00:08:06.100
-Whoa, that's quite the tease.

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:07.601
Putin has no idea what's coming.

00:08:07.601 --> 00:08:09.200
Looks like someone
prepped for his speech

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:12.267
by watching "Taken" again.
[ Laughter ]

00:08:12.267 --> 00:08:14.133
Also, I'll be impressed
if that's true,

00:08:14.133 --> 00:08:16.400
because villains like Putin
always like to think

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:19.033
they know what's coming.
I'm betting no one's ever seen

00:08:19.033 --> 00:08:21.267
Putin make a shocked expression
in his life.

00:08:21.267 --> 00:08:22.868
I don't even know
what that would look like.

00:08:22.868 --> 00:08:25.400
Can you imagine throwing
a surprise party for him?

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.501
Surprise!

00:08:26.501 --> 00:08:27.501
[ As Putin ] No, not surprise.

00:08:27.501 --> 00:08:29.234
I read your text
for the last month.

00:08:29.234 --> 00:08:33.133
Also, I do not like clapping
for birthdays, Chuck.

00:08:37.934 --> 00:08:41.133
Better Chuck, better.

00:08:41.133 --> 00:08:42.601
[ Normal voice ]
And true to Biden's word,

00:08:42.601 --> 00:08:45.000
today, the Justice Department
followed through and announced

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.367
a new task force to go after

00:08:46.367 --> 00:08:48.534
Russian elites
called KleptoCapture

00:08:48.534 --> 00:08:51.567
to track down wealth
of sanctioned Russian oligarchs

00:08:51.567 --> 00:08:53.634
aimed at ensuring the U.S.
can seize the money

00:08:53.634 --> 00:08:55.767
of sanctioned
Russian elite tied to Putin.

00:08:55.767 --> 00:08:57.601
Now, the name KleptoCapture
is a reference

00:08:57.601 --> 00:08:59.667
to capturing the wealth
of Russian kleptocrats.

00:08:59.667 --> 00:09:03.300
So we're going after oligarchs,
plutocrats, and kleptocrats.

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:04.601
I'm sorry,
but why do we have so many

00:09:04.601 --> 00:09:05.968
different words
for rich criminal?

00:09:05.968 --> 00:09:07.834
I feel like I have to walk
around with a damn thesaurus

00:09:07.834 --> 00:09:09.801
all day
just to understand the news.

00:09:09.801 --> 00:09:11.367
Why can't we just call it
the Taking Money

00:09:11.367 --> 00:09:13.701
From Suspiciously Wealthy
Beet Farmers Task Force?

00:09:13.701 --> 00:09:15.067
[ Laughter ]

00:09:15.067 --> 00:09:17.067
KleptoCapture sounds like
the name of a lesser known

00:09:17.067 --> 00:09:20.000
Bond movie from the '80s
starring Roger Moore.

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:21.934
[ British accent ]
Bad news, James. After
you defeated Moonraker,

00:09:21.934 --> 00:09:23.934
they came up with an even
more powerful weapon.

00:09:23.934 --> 00:09:26.067
It's called KleptoCapture.
[ As Bond ] What does it do?

00:09:26.067 --> 00:09:28.567
[ British accent ] Hold on, let
me flip through my thesaurus.

00:09:28.567 --> 00:09:31.100
[ Laughter ]

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:33.667
[ Normal voice ]
But there's certainly a lot
of elite Russian wealth

00:09:33.667 --> 00:09:35.133
to go after,
in addition to the yachts

00:09:35.133 --> 00:09:37.300
and condos and private jets,
the U.S. and its allies

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.334
are also going after
a special type of passport

00:09:39.334 --> 00:09:41.734
that apparently only rich
oligarchs get to use.

00:09:41.734 --> 00:09:44.767
-There will be a trans-Atlantic
international task force

00:09:44.767 --> 00:09:49.434
to target wealthy Russians
who have luxury yachts,

00:09:49.434 --> 00:09:52.701
luxury apartments,
and use golden passports.

00:09:52.701 --> 00:09:54.834
Those are the things
that essentially allow you

00:09:54.834 --> 00:09:56.701
to become a citizen
of another country

00:09:56.701 --> 00:10:00.767
to either hide your wealth
or escape Russia.

00:10:00.767 --> 00:10:03.667
There's such a thing
as a golden passport.

00:10:03.667 --> 00:10:06.000
I guess that would explain
why every time I go to JFK,

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.367
there's a special line
of security

00:10:07.367 --> 00:10:08.634
filled with Russian oligarchs

00:10:08.634 --> 00:10:10.801
complaining about
how slow the TSA is.

00:10:10.801 --> 00:10:12.033
[ Brooklyn accent ]
Shoes and belts off.

00:10:12.033 --> 00:10:13.334
[ Russian accent ]
But I have golden passport.

00:10:13.334 --> 00:10:14.901
[ Brooklyn accent ] Buddy,
I don't care if you got

00:10:14.901 --> 00:10:16.901
the golden goose.

00:10:16.901 --> 00:10:19.133
Shoes and belts off
and no liquids.

00:10:19.133 --> 00:10:23.434
[ Russian accent ]
But golden passport
allowed me four ounces.

00:10:23.434 --> 00:10:26.267
[ Brooklyn accent ] Willy Wonka
over here got a golden passport.

00:10:29.167 --> 00:10:31.200
Willy Wonkavich over here.

00:10:33.701 --> 00:10:36.834
What are you taking
the glass elevator?

00:10:36.834 --> 00:10:38.133
You got one ticket?

00:10:38.133 --> 00:10:40.367
Yeah, I'm reading
a lot of Roald Dahl at home.

00:10:44.801 --> 00:10:46.901
[ Normal voice ]
Now, Biden is anticipating
that some of these sanctions

00:10:46.901 --> 00:10:49.267
and the instability caused
by the conflict may contribute

00:10:49.267 --> 00:10:51.567
to inflation and rising
gas prices, among other things.

00:10:51.567 --> 00:10:54.601
So we took a moment to speak
directly to the American people

00:10:54.601 --> 00:10:56.801
and tried to reassure them
that everything would be fine.

00:10:56.801 --> 00:10:59.400
-To all Americans,
I'll be honest with you,

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:03.334
as I always promised I would be,
a Russian dictator aff--

00:11:03.334 --> 00:11:08.934
invading a foreign country
has cost around the world.

00:11:08.934 --> 00:11:10.968
And I'm taking robust action
to make sure

00:11:10.968 --> 00:11:14.767
the pain of our sanctions
is targeted at Russian economy.

00:11:14.767 --> 00:11:16.868
And that we use every tool
at our disposal

00:11:16.868 --> 00:11:19.534
to protect American businesses
and consumers.

00:11:19.534 --> 00:11:22.634
These steps will help blunt
gas prices here at home,

00:11:22.634 --> 00:11:24.267
but I know news about
what's happening

00:11:24.267 --> 00:11:27.100
can seem
alarming to all Americans.

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:30.501
But I want you to know
we're going to be okay.

00:11:30.501 --> 00:11:32.033
We're going to be okay.

00:11:32.033 --> 00:11:33.734
-You know, things aren't
exactly going great

00:11:33.734 --> 00:11:36.400
when the President adopts
the tone of a husband who just

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:38.901
told his wife he blew all their
money at the racetrack.

00:11:38.901 --> 00:11:41.133
"We're going to be okay, baby.
I've got a plan.

00:11:41.133 --> 00:11:43.400
My buddy, Chuck and I
are going to start a business

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:45.133
selling fake Nike's
in Times Square."

00:11:45.133 --> 00:11:48.000
Chuck, tell her
how good the plan is."

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:50.834
Chuck!
Oh, Chuck, come on.

00:11:50.834 --> 00:11:53.534
Don't do me like this man."

00:11:53.534 --> 00:11:54.801
Last night, Biden applauded

00:11:54.801 --> 00:11:56.701
the bravery and courage
of the Ukrainian people

00:11:56.701 --> 00:11:58.501
and laid out
a strong response to Russia

00:11:58.501 --> 00:12:00.901
that will punish them
financially while being careful

00:12:00.901 --> 00:12:02.801
to avoid
any direct military conflict

00:12:02.801 --> 00:12:05.133
that could drastically
escalate the situation

00:12:05.133 --> 00:12:07.467
which no one wants.
And yet some Republicans

00:12:07.467 --> 00:12:08.868
couldn't even be bothered
to show up,

00:12:08.868 --> 00:12:10.534
while others were just
disruptive jerks.

00:12:10.534 --> 00:12:12.501
Every time I remember
these insane people

00:12:12.501 --> 00:12:14.634
are elected officials,
I have to look in the mirror

00:12:14.634 --> 00:12:17.501
and tell myself
we're going to be okay.

00:12:17.501 --> 00:12:19.033
This has been "A Closer Look."

